{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crosshair Pro is a modern <strong>desktop crosshair overlay</strong> for competitive FPS/TPS. It\u2019s <strong>injection-free</strong>, delivering <strong>stable</strong>, <strong>low-latency</strong>, and <strong>highly customizable</strong> targeting for streams and everyday play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live sizing; fine thickness/gap/opacity; axis lock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradient &amp; glow; layered design (dot/ring/line)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-perfect alignment; auto profile by active EXE (EXE Profiles 2.0)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBS-friendly; global hotkeys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PNG/SVG export; preset Share/Import</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Injection-free, low-latency overlay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paint++ (64\u00d764)</strong>: pixel &amp; freehand; rectangle/ellipse/line/triangle; grid thickness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per-layer color/gradient/glow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBS capture mode; tray; multi-monitor &amp; DPI support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EN/TR UI; anti-cheat-friendly architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADS Auto-Hide: While holding right-click, the crosshair hides automatically; it returns on release (not shown inside scope). <i>Optional: enable via checkbox.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s New</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paint++</strong>: 64\u00d764 canvas, shapes, grid thickness, import &amp; \u201cApply to Preset\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better OBS &amp; click-through; improved tray; DPI/multi-monitor tweaks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Is It For?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive FPS/TPS players and OBS streamers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creators who want pixel-level crosshair design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> If the crosshair is invisible in some games, use <strong>Borderless/Windowed Fullscreen</strong> mode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102760?t=1772702681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102760?t=1772702681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102760/2b184c665439c2b8a35fe34341d5838ea3255d57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772702681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102760/2b184c665439c2b8a35fe34341d5838ea3255d57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772702681","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crosshair Pro is a modern <strong>desktop crosshair overlay</strong> for competitive FPS/TPS. It\u2019s <strong>injection-free</strong>, delivering <strong>stable</strong>, <strong>low-latency</strong>, and <strong>highly customizable</strong> targeting for streams and everyday play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live sizing; fine thickness/gap/opacity; axis lock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradient &amp; glow; layered design (dot/ring/line)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-perfect alignment; auto profile by active EXE (EXE Profiles 2.0)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBS-friendly; global hotkeys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PNG/SVG export; preset Share/Import</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Injection-free, low-latency overlay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragr